Cell["\<\
Use this guide to calculate a probability, interpret its interval and \
uncertainty components, and reproduce the result in Wolfram Language. The \
reference example estimates the probability that a person's \
analytical-error-free OGTT at the same visit reaches the chosen threshold. \
Clinical diagnosis requires separate evidence.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"56966892-af19-9b48-8069-d95e5a54c491"],

