Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Model checking and limits", "Subsection",
 FontColor->RGBColor[
  0.8, 0.043137254901960784`, 
   0.00784313725490196],ExpressionUUID->"aee6063b-642d-004c-aa0d-\
f4deeb33ee58"],

Cell["Internal holdout measured-OGTT Brier \
0.030437 versus constant training-fraction 0.039372. Fourteen holdout positives limit calibration \
assessment; among 14 people with FPG \[GreaterEqual]120, 7 are positive versus 4.218 expected. Posterior \
predictive log FPG kurtosis remains inadequately reproduced (upper-tail probability 0.024). The \
two-component model is illustrative and requires further validation before clinical use. The \
single-Gaussian sensitivity gives probability 0.153257 at 126, demonstrating material model dependence."\
, "Text", ExpressionUUID -> "bbd95691-3be5-1a43-b0b3-ff0e0f22ba5f"],

Cell["The iid Bayesian posterior \
describes the selected cohort. OGTT-weighted descriptive positivity 3.2529 percent with Taylor SE 0.4565 \
percentage points uses WTSOG2YR, 15 strata and 30 PSUs; additional eligibility weights were not \
recalibrated. These descriptive survey results do not convert the iid posterior into a population \
posterior.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> "13fe5301-fd7d-f44a-8c7c-80f7d29f4811"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Archived held-out comparison", "Section",
 FontSize->24,
 FontColor->RGBColor[0.8, 0.043137254901960784`, 0.00784313725490196],
 CellTags->"Holdout",ExpressionUUID->"bc4ffa4a-9bc9-9d41-88d6-2b7e5f0b7148"],

Cell["Evaluation added 18 October \
2026. Adding age did not demonstrate improved predictive calibration on the original holdout. Both \
frozen models were trained on the same 1,361 participants and evaluated on the same 341 held-out \
participants, including 14 measured OGTT positives (4.11%). This section compares the separate two- and \
three-dimensional saved fits; it does not alter the calculator, posterior draws or latent-endpoint \
uncertainty results above.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> "bfe86f71-9f9b-f94b-90f4-59122e7e6f13"],

Cell["The evaluation endpoint is measured same-visit OGTT at least 200 mg/dL. Probabilities \
use total observed-reference covariance, measured FPG, and each participant's actual recorded age for \
the age model. Component and posterior-draw likelihood weights condition on the observed predictors. \
This is distinct from evaluating an analytical-error-free reference endpoint against observed labels. \
The original split and training rows were verified; neither predictive model was refitted, selected, \
tuned or recalibrated on this holdout.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
             "2e8aabc0-27e2-0b48-8632-a142ab0c5420"],

Cell[BoxData[TagBox[GridBox[{{"\"Measure\"", "\"Without age (95% CI)\"", 
                 "\"With age (95% CI)\""}, {"\"Mean predicted risk\"", TemplateBox[
                  {TagBox[InterpretationBox[StyleBox["\"0.0295\"", ShowStringCharacters -> False], 
                     0.029459748666939584, AutoDelete -> True], NumberForm[#1, {8, 4}] & ], "\" (\"", 
